{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "b2a0b96309799c0d7d3b9ec9e80e1b98c2d74968265663eb23a374963615324c", "ja": "おとぎ話のはじまり", "zh": "童话故事的开端", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "21bf28af67197a873a52c08fee491f1e373dffaa5b3b1fb30e1f18724494be1e", "ja": "映画『おとぎの国の物語』への出演が\n決まったアイドル達。撮影が楽しみな星梨花\nに、桃子は主役として自覚を持つよう話す。\nみんなが撮影に向けて気合いを入れる中、\n星梨花は少し、思い悩んだ様子を見せる。", "zh": "偶像们获选演出电影《童话王国的故事》，\n桃子告诉满心期待拍摄的星梨花\n要有身为主角的自觉。\n在大家为拍摄工作提起干劲的时候，\n星梨花看起来却有点忧虑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "985b9167cb492627018a27b3fe3ccb4059c068776c763bddf415ade5d12b2dd8", "ja": "（今日は、『おとぎの国の物語』に出演する\nメンバーの顔合わせだ。そろそろ時間だけど……）", "zh": "（今天是《童话王国的故事》演出成员的初次会面，\n时间差不多了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b648b862af3db0a09a2c0d807bade3db20060dcdef651968eb5e5a7accfbe5a0", "ja": "お疲れさま。みんな、集まってるか？", "zh": "辛苦了，大家都到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "14f67325278703861ed43061ed23423da0949cb359fa80840a896f1ebfa9a8bb", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\nはい、もうみなさん集まってますよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你也辛苦了！\n是的，大家都到齐啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "1a1b94fbfac6cadcacb77f3283e3e62a82a8085f2bad90204f5bc633deafab34", "ja": "今日は、新しいお仕事のお話なんですよね？　どんな\nお仕事なんでしょう……わたし、とっても楽しみです！", "zh": "今天要谈新的工作对吧？\n是怎样的工作呢……我好期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "0db4cc0c8fce17ef70750ec99e93db69689674e5962a3beac4d98bbcfb691d14", "ja": "このメンバーでする仕事ってコトだもんな。\nライブとか……？　オレも、すっげー気になる！", "zh": "是这些成员要一起做的工作吧？\n会是演唱会之类的吗……？我也超好奇的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b91edebc8ba102755e4f626e0cb3aa029493ab1d961489a375b7f0e72bcbfb94", "ja": "まあまあ。今から詳しい話をするから、\n他のみんなも聞いてくれ。", "zh": "别急别急，接下来我会详细说明，\n其他人也一起听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a2212b6c01d2e13c1ce08147b6666682f96746b40eb35d2f70813650a140eb15", "ja": "みんなに集まってもらったのは、他でもない。以前\nオーディションを受けてもらった、新作映画の件だ。", "zh": "今天召集大家过来不为别的，\n是关于各位之前参加试镜的那部新电影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "f29848dd28ec5cbd11d5a72c95c70207706084c7395fe9c080cd7de599b22834", "ja": "えっと、『おとぎの国の物語』……だったっけ？\nオーディションも、おとぎ話風のセリフだったよね！", "zh": "你是指……《童话王国的故事》吗？\n试镜时也是用童话故事风的台词对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "413e6611ac1e6af4a73ede4cf8e5f8d6824e20a4fba48e55b5422a4b543c9ee5", "ja": "ああ、その作品だ。その結果……\nここにいる全員の、出演が決まった！", "zh": "没错，就是那部作品。\n试镜的结果……在场的各位全都获选参与演出了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "64c71ebb70e73c8da9bf6e1f09258a298c62322b8ced4461bb4d3a23c09471a0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、本当ですか！？\nわたしたちみんな、映画に出られるんですか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，真的吗！？\n我们大家都能登上大银幕了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "13162636df94bb7ce1117816d6b74c8c6403d18523c70d93539f8b720651f860", "ja": "やったー！（わんだほー！）", "zh": "太棒了──！（太美妙了──！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太棒了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太棒了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "4aca776a79ce0db07a50c8ddb2b8011f612045174fb9541892d77e4f89a22fab", "ja": "わんだほー！", "zh": "太美妙了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "b22971025d39819741820ae97fd6ef16c098bf9d11106c3fe5647ffd8932dc70", "ja": "ま、まあ、桃子の実力なら当然の結果だけどね。\n……それでお兄ちゃん、誰がどんな役に決まったの？", "zh": "不、不过这结果以桃子的实力来说也是理所当然的。\n……那么，大哥哥，每个人的角色都已经决定了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "97c815057dd1794bbc2ece9a15e64f19dd04c440b491b453ca267caf2f857acb", "ja": "ああ。今から決定稿の台本を配るから、\nみんな自分の役と、話の内容を確認してみてくれ。", "zh": "对，接下来会把定稿版的剧本发下去，\n麻烦大家确认自己的角色跟故事内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "a4c345a6e4630c137022fe0c15b4c59ea1a95958652bf06ddb10df4098d73e26", "ja": "ふ～ん。おとぎ話だけど、そのままじゃないんだ。\n……まつりの魔法使いって、なんか面白い役だね？", "zh": "哦～虽然是童话故事，但并非照本宣科啊。\n……茉莉的魔法使感觉是很有趣的角色呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "8caaea850228a51ac494d9b9d4b34d22a9fb65fd51d43c85ca61b8b9cc44dbb1", "ja": "響ちゃんのオオカミさんも、とっても素敵なのです。\nどんな衣装なのか、今から楽しみなのです♪", "zh": "小响的大野狼也非常棒的喔，\n茉莉现在就好期待你会穿怎样的服装♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "eb80f727ecc33d089e6a0ba54ac27fdb525c146909b1d0ad63aa4a7f1274353a", "ja": "うん、まかせてよっ！　オオカミ役だって、\n自分がカンペキにこなしてみせるさー！", "zh": "嗯，交给本人吧！\n本人会把大野狼诠释得很完美啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "99177013eabea3dd9867a2066ec5ac6374981122b65e6bbc0d511b4644f67911", "ja": "へぇー、うっかりな妖精なんているんだなー。\nでも、桃子がうっかりってなんか意外かも！", "zh": "哦～原来也有脱线的妖精啊～？\n不过，脱线的桃子感觉挺出乎意料的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "38b2dc6e675690b99b5ad4e2f81a15a691531b08ba2074dcae61c4b5dab26dcf", "ja": "お芝居なんだから意外なほうがいいんだよ、昴さん。\n桃子は女優だし、いろんな役ができて当然だからね♪", "zh": "这是演戏，出乎意料比较好啊，昴姊。\n而且桃子是演员，能扮演各种角色是理所当然的嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "9a0eec4285f2e4830dbbe507ba7754020e7da7b9a73e65384c2d327be5d0f5b1", "ja": "あ、そっか！　じゃあ、オレの旅人は……意外か？\nうーん……？", "zh": "啊，原来如此！那我的旅人……会出乎意料吗？\n唔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "85e4ae43fd249e45f98fa6a1961ed578c11bdcf31d497fdd9223f9b0110f7198", "ja": "意外かどうかはわかりませんけど、昴さんの旅人さん、\nわたしは見てみたいです。きっと素敵だと思います！", "zh": "虽然不晓得会不会出乎意料，\n但我很想看看小昴姊姊扮演的旅人，肯定会很棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "047a8717bb27cd73ab5e31517e11d6f8068ee4a4a01337d3ac9800ef41675eda", "ja": "へへっ、そっか？　サンキュな！\n星梨花の少女って役も、ピッタリだと思うぜ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，是吗？谢啦！\n我觉得少女这个角色也很适合星梨花喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "8363a14c8de417f5190153340746016253071946f88d2999b057a9e128d69758", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nえへへ……♪", "zh": "谢谢！\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8601979ae8d881d0d9dc56f3c9aedf14fa74e2b9dd12cd3791cec76c37a2c289", "ja": "そうそう。今回の映画には、みんなの他にも\n雪歩と貴音がゲスト出演する予定なんだ。", "zh": "对了，这次的电影除了你们之外，\n雪步和贵音也预计会客串演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "17ec3e7f25f50e505ebea2587809a1b287abc6f89b45daa94c6c1d49d015dd45", "ja": "雪歩さんと、貴音さんもですか？\nみなさん一緒だなんて、今から撮影が楽しみですね♪", "zh": "还有雪步姊姊跟贵音姊姊吗？\n没想到可以跟大家一起工作，我已经开始期待拍摄了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "3cadf5c76c8f2862804436979b0fc6cc95cd206171eb3bbe65b9ec95554fba18", "ja": "撮影を楽しみにするのはいいけど……\n星梨花、もしかして大事なこと忘れてない？", "zh": "期待拍摄是无所谓……\n但星梨花，你是不是忘了一件很重要的事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "ed131c8089a50150ab3c627418da12894197f6dae3abe2171f9f038b207cb22a", "ja": "今回の映画って、主役は星梨花でしょ？\nそうだよね、お兄ちゃん。", "zh": "这次电影的主角是星梨花吧？\n没错吧，大哥哥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "d70e532c87f4e53ca5e5319b3308a92368f79b503c56a4c1e90bb0024e4321a0", "ja": "そうだな。主演という位置づけではないけど、物語の\n主役という意味では、少女……星梨花になると思う。", "zh": "这个嘛，虽然没有被定位为主演，\n但以故事主角来说……应该就是饰演少女的星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "0ea3c3ad164a0e89a13bb0665ecbdec2d1a809d6c2dab819f8242cd95f372766", "ja": "えっ。わ、わたしが、主役なんですか？", "zh": "咦？我、我是主角？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "437d2159784c1d53deea3ed47f4882dccc2f5c3890458bbef14c3536ccaa64fb", "ja": "そう！　お話の主役は大事なんだよ。星梨花は、\n主役としての意識をちゃんと持つこと！　いい？", "zh": "没错！故事主角是很重要的。\n你要有身为主角的自觉！懂吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1032_049mom", "source_sha256": "b3373e1ff8e51a89968437dfaaec0ed865ca1def462c40f09be57f2e065b92df", "ja": "そうでないと、せっかく星梨花が\n少女役に選ばれた意味が、なくなっちゃうよ。", "zh": "要不然的话，\n你好不容易被选中饰演少女就没意义了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "7a48ec012b8639aa31ce79a74b1c3cdde8583c4d16b445f04d46978f4430c71e", "ja": "まあまあ、桃子。星梨花も。撮影はこれからだし、\nみんなで一緒に頑張っていけば大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "好了好了，桃子、星梨花。\n拍摄是之后的事，大家一起努力就不会有问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "00921005846c2aa8ad799204f7a0b2b99cb74c38662505c00783021f74629b15", "ja": "もう、お兄ちゃんは甘いんだから。\n言っておくけど、芸能界は厳しいんだからね！", "zh": "真是的，大哥哥你太天真了啦。\n桃子把话说在前头，演艺圈是很严苛的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "aa4e772bc6868fc6bc274ef324c2d499873e2bc03cabd43d289a9c539464a18b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、桃子ちゃん……\nわ、わかりました！　わたし、がんばります！", "zh": "{$P$}先生、小桃……\n我、我明白了！我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1037_013hib", "source_sha256": "11d32930adb7bc1f6666986a95fa2fcda579bb43d91045d31fe00b06e491ffc5", "ja": "星梨花、わからないことがあったら自分に聞いて！\n自分はセンパイだから、なんでも教えるぞ！", "zh": "星梨花，要是有不懂的地方，就问本人吧！\n本人是前辈，什么都会教你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1038_021mat", "source_sha256": "9f3ba9b359a4a859c92c907d49447ebf8849d46116cc159c145ae9d916f2d906", "ja": "もちろん、姫に聞いてもいいのです。\nみんなで一緒に、ぱわほー！に励むのです～。", "zh": "当然也可以问公主的唷。\n大家要一起强大地加油的喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1039_047sub", "source_sha256": "5823f72a8587e6801c44fcb4afc2bf02f94b8c281cc89446d55f7a0a6c2505eb", "ja": "オレは、教えられることとか特にないけど……\nでも一緒にがんばるくらいは、できると思うぜ！", "zh": "我没什么能够教你的东西……\n但我至少可以跟你一起努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "08aaf9f765ad932269e1b39b2061477902c123ed7ddb61ae57f4b5de376966bb", "ja": "みなさん……ありがとうございます！\nえへへ……♪", "zh": "各位……谢谢你们！\n嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "148fcf692923e14afd6fbec6f888e3ad5786df53761b55e2e2bb5e3b83a6d2d5", "ja": "（みんな、気合いが入ってるな。\nこの分なら、映画も良い作品になりそうだ……）", "zh": "（大家都卯足了干劲呢，\n看样子电影也会成为一部好作品吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0102_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0102_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "7e2dc0f302c434077c25196a82b91960a97bf08bf7bc569ee021fafb812b2d27", "ja": "（星梨花の様子が、まだ少し気になるけど……。\nしばらく、様子を見守ってみよう）", "zh": "（我还是有点在意星梨花的状况……\n先观望一阵子吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
